## Why This Is Asked
Tests understanding of QUIC edge behavior, roaming networks, and realistic debugging plans.

## Key Concepts
- QUIC connection migration
- Edge CDN revalidation
- DNS path variation and ECMP

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-logic to correlate migration events from edge logs
function correlateMigration(logs) {
  const byCID = new Map();
  for (const e of logs) {
    if (e.type === 'migration') byCID.set(e.cid, e);
  }
  return byCID;
}
```

